#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Kalendar is a calendar application that allows you to manage your tasks and"
" events. Kalendar supports both local calendars as well as a multitude of"
" online calendars: Nextcloud, Google® Calendar, Outlook®, Caldav, and many"
" more."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:16
msgid ""
"Kalendar gives you many ways to interact with your events. The month view"
" provides an overview of the entire month; the week view presents a detailed"
" hour-by-hour overview of your week; and the schedule view lists all of your"
" upcoming events so that you can easily and quickly plan ahead."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:17
msgid ""
"A tasks view is also available, making it possible for you to manage your"
" tasks and subtasks with Kalendar's powerful tree view and its customisable"
" filtering capabilities."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:18
msgid ""
"Kalendar was built with the idea to be usable on desktop, on mobile and"
" everything in between."
msgstr ""

